      "content": "Post 1 passes; it's just casual slang. Post 2 fails; it clearly targets a group based on origin and suggests they are unwelcome. Post 3 passes; it's just general insults without targeting protected characteristics. Post 4 fails; it uses coded language to promote xenophobic fears about demographic changes.",
